\" font-size=\"884px\">\u00a0</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Now, we round 205.333 to one decimal place :</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>The digit at the first decimal place is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10.936ex\" height=\"1.557ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -666 4833.6 688\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(777.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2055.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(2278,0)\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p></li>\n<li><p>The digit following it is 3 (which is less than 5 ) \u2192 205.3</p></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the rounded result is 205.3 m . Hence, the correct option is (A)</p>"},"hi":{"direction":null,"comprehension":null,"content":"<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"121.216ex\" height=\"2.149ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 53577.7 950\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www