ata-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(2278,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(2778,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(13890.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">\u00a0</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>\u0905\u092c, \u0939\u092e 205.333 \u0915\u094b \u090f\u0915 \u0926\u0936\u092e\u0932\u0935 \u0938\u094d\u0925\u093e\u0928 \u0924\u0915 \u092a\u0942\u0930\u094d\u0923\u093e\u0902\u0915\u093f\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>\u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 \u0926\u0936\u092e\u0932\u0935 \u0938\u094d\u0925\u093e\u0928 \u092a\u0930 \u0905\u0902\u0915 <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.131ex\" height=\"1.554ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -665 500 687\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> \u0939\u0948 <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.176ex\" height=\"1.557ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -666 4055.8 688\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1277.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(2278,0)\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p></li>\n<li><p>\u0907\u0938\u0915\u0947 \u092c\u093e\u0926 \u0915\u093e \u0905\u0902\u0915 3 \u0939\u0948 (\u091c\u094b 5 \u0938\u0947 \u0915\u092e \u0939\u0948) \u2192 205.3</p></li>\n</ul>\n<p>\u0907\u0938\u0932\u093f\u090f, \u092a\u0942\u0930\u094d\u0923\u093e\u0902\u0915\u093f\u0924 \u092a\u0930\u093f\u0923\u093e\u092e 205.3 m \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0905\u0924\u0903 \u0938\u0939\u0940 \u0935\u093f\u0915\u0932\u094d\u092a (A) \u0939\u0948\u0964</p>"}},"section":["chapter","paper"],"subject":"physics","timeAllotted":144000,"topic":"errors-in-measurement","type":"mcq","year":2026,"tags":[],"bookmark":{"en":{"title":"JEE Main 2026 (Online) 21st January Evening Shift","subTitle":"Units and Measurements \u2022 Physics","excerpt":"Keeping the significant figures in view, the sum of the physical quantities 52.01 m, 153.2 m and 0.123 m is :"},"hi":{"title":"JEE Main 2026 (Online) 21st January Evening Shift","subTitle":"Units and Measurements \u2022 Physics","excerpt":"$$ \\text { \u0938\u093e\u0930\u094d\u0925\u0915 \u0938\u0902\u0916\u094d\u092f\u093e\u0913\u0902 \u0915\u094b \u0926\u0943\u0937\u094d\u091f\u093f\u0917\u0924 \u0930\u0916\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0942\u090f, \u092d\u094c\u0924\u093f\u0915 \u0930\u093e\u0936\u093f\u092f\u094b\u0902 } 52.01 \\mathrm{~m}, 153.2 \\mathrm{~m} \\text { \u0914\u0930 } 0.123 \\mathrm{~m} \\text { \u0915\u093e \u092f\u094b\u0917 \u0939\u0948 : } $$"}},"yearKey":"jee-main-2026-online-21st-january-evening-shift","qKey":"pkeeping-the-significant-figures-in-view-the-sum-of-the-p-jee-main-physics-dawrguhvrm33nnp6","questions":[{"question_id":"ml7rl0df","chapter":"units-and-measurements","chapterGroup":"mechanics","country":"in","difficulty":"easy","exam":"jee-main","examGroup":"jee","isBonus":false,"isOutOfSyllabus":false,"languages":["en","hi"],"marks":4,"negMarks":1,"paperId":"jee-main-2026-online-21st-january-evening-shift","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2026 (Online) 21st January Evening Shift","permalink":"pkeeping-the-significant-figures-in-view-the-sum-of-the-p-jee-main-physics-dawrguhvrm33nnp6","question":{"en":{"comprehension":null,"direction":null,"content":"<p>Keeping the significant figures in view, the sum of the physical quantities 52.01 m, 153.2 m and 0.123 m is :</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"<p>205.3 m</p>"},{"identifier":"B","content":"<p>205 m</p>"},{"identifier":"C","content":"<p>205.333 m</p>"},{"identifier":"D","content":"<p>205.33 m</p>"}],"correct_options":["A"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>In addition, or subtraction, the final result should be reported to the same number of decimal places as the measurement with the least number of decimal places. This ensures the result is no more precise than the least precise measurement.</p>\n<p>The given measured values are,</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11.413ex\" height=\"2.149ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 5044.6 950\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(2278,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">\u00a0</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3988.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(4544.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> decimal places.</p></li>\n<li><p>153.2 m : 1 decimal place.</p></li>\n<li><p>0.123 m : 3 decimal places.</p></li>\n</ul>\n<p>The measurement with the least number of decimal places is 153.2 m ( 1 decimal place). Therefore, our final answer must be rounded to one decimal place.</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"34.668ex\" height=\"2.149ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 15323.4 950\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2500.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3500.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(6000.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(7000.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(9556.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(10612.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(2278,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(2778,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(13890.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">\u00a0</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Now, we round 205.333 to one decimal place :</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>The digit at the first decimal place is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10.936ex\" height=\"1.557ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -666 4833.6 688\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(777.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2055.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(2278,0)\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p></li>\n<li><p>The digit following it is 3 (which is less than 5 ) \u2192 205.3</p></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the rounded result is 205.3 m . Hence, the correct option is (A)</p>"},"hi":{"direction":null,"comprehension":null,"content":"<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"121.216ex\" height=\"2.149ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 53577.7 950\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">\u00a0\u0938\u093e\u0930\u094d\u0925\u0915 \u0938\u0902\u0916\u094d\u092f\u093e\u0913\u0902 \u0915\u094b \u0926\u0943\u0937\u094d\u091f\u093f\u0917\u0924 \u0930\u0916\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0942\u090f, \u092d\u094c\u0924\u093f\u0915 \u0930\u093e\u0936\u093f\u092f\u094b\u0902\u00a0</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(31800,0)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(34078,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">\u00a0</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D